WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.342
Toad splashed his arms in the water.

2
00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:22.622
The water was flowing fast.

3
00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:26.541
He held his head above the waves.

4
00:00:26.542 --> 00:00:30.135
"I'm in the river!" he cried.

5
00:00:30.136 --> 00:00:33.743
The waves turned him over.

6
00:00:33.744 --> 00:00:38.933
"Oh my!" Toad yelled. "Help!"

7
00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.682
His head went under.

8
00:00:41.683 --> 00:00:45.411
He swallowed a gulp of water.

9
00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.351
Toad's head popped up again.

10
00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:49.872
He coughed.

11
00:00:49.873 --> 00:00:55.296
"I'll never steal another car!" cried Toad.

12
00:00:55.297 --> 00:00:59.412
"I'll never sing another song!"

13
00:00:59.413 --> 00:01:03.196
Under the water he went again.

14
00:01:03.197 --> 00:01:07.066
"Oh dear," he said with a splash.

15
00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.537
His head popped up once more.

16
00:01:10.538 --> 00:01:16.146
"I'll never tell another lie!" he cried.

17
00:01:16.147 --> 00:01:20.500
Toad grabbed the reeds on the bank.

18
00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:25.205
But the reeds broke off in his hands.

19
00:01:25.206 --> 00:01:29.427
In the riverbank ahead was a round hole.

20
00:01:29.428 --> 00:01:34.214
"Maybe I can grab onto it," said Toad.

21
00:01:34.215 --> 00:01:38.081
"Here it comes!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:38.082 --> 00:01:41.215
The waves carried him closer.

23
00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:46.211
Now the dark opening was just above him.

24
00:01:46.212 --> 00:01:50.077
Toad reached for the edge of the hole.

25
00:01:50.078 --> 00:01:55.693
"I made it!" said Toad, holding on.

26
00:01:55.694 --> 00:01:59.682
He was only halfway out of the water.

27
00:01:59.683 --> 00:02:03.845
"I'll catch my breath here," he said.

28
00:02:03.846 --> 00:02:08.813
Two bright eyes shone out of the hole.

29
00:02:08.814 --> 00:02:11.950
"What's that?" said Toad.

30
00:02:11.951 --> 00:02:16.210
Then a small brown face appeared.

31
00:02:16.211 --> 00:02:19.395
It was Rat!
